(7670948, 1252147, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wychmere harbor ~  one of Harwich Port''s gems.  It''s great how from this angle you can appreciate its origins as a deep kettle pond. I was so tickled when I learned that before it was opened up to form a harbor, a track for racing horses and horse drawn carts was built around it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-07-27 21:15:01.</i></td>', 'Wychmere harbor ~  one of Harwich Port''s gems.  It''s great how from this angle you can appreciate its origins as a deep kettle pond. I was so tickled when I learned that before it was opened up to form a harbor, a track for racing horses and horse drawn carts was built around it.', '2020-07-27 13:31:53.000000', '2020-07-27 22:15:01.000000', 0),
